αὐθαίρετος|a�qa�retoj|auhairetps|1) voluntary, of free choice, of one's own accord<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective|<b>G830</b><br />From G846 and the same as G140; <i>self chosen</i>, that is, (by implication) <i>voluntary:</i> - of own accord, willing of self.<br />|830|
