βαθύνω|baq�nw|bahunz|1) 'the deep' sea (the 'high seas')<br />2) deep, extreme poverty, the deep things of God, things hidden and above man's scrutiny, especially divine counsels<br />3) to make deep<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G900</b><br />From G901; to <i>deepen:</i> - deep.<br />|900|
