βαρέω|bar�w|barez|1) to burden, weigh down, depress<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 1:558, 95|<b>G916</b><br />From G926; to <i>weigh</i> down (figuratively): - burden, charge, heavy, press.<br />|916|
