βασανισμός|basanism�j|basanismps|1) to torture, a testing by the touchstone, which is a black siliceous stone used to test the purity of gold or silver by the colour of the streak produced on it by rubbing it with either metal<br />2) torment, torture<br />2a) the act of tormenting<br />2b) the state or condition of those tormented<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 1:561, 96|<b>G929</b><br />From G928; <i>torture:</i> - torment.<br />|929|
