γάρ|g�r|car|1) for<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> conjunction|<b>G1063</b><br />A primary particle; properly assigning a <i>reason</i> (used in argument, explanation or intensification; often with other particles): - and, as, because (that), but, even, for indeed, no doubt, seeing, then, therefore, verily, what, why, yet.<br />|1063|
