γερουσία|gerous�a|cerpusia|1) a senate, council of elders<br />1a) to denote the chief council of nations or cities<br />1b) the Sanhedrin<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun feminine|<b>G1087</b><br />From G1088; the <i>eldership</i>, that is, (collectively) the Jewish <i>Sanhedrim:</i> - senate.<br />|1087|
