γεύομαι|ge�omai|ceupmai|1) to taste, to try the flavour of<br />2) to taste<br />2a) i.e. perceive the flavour of, partake of, enjoy<br />2b) to feel, make trial of, experience<br />3) to take food, eat, to take nourishment, eat<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 1:675, 117|<b>G1089</b><br />A primary verb; to <i>taste</i>; by implication to <i>eat</i>; figuratively to <i>experience</i> (good or ill): - eat, taste.<br />|1089|
