δεσμοφύλαξ|desmof�lax|desmpvulao|1) a keeper of a prison, a jailor<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G1200</b><br />From G1199 and G5441; a <i>jailer</i> (as <i>guarding</i> the <i>prisoners</i>): - jailer, keeper of the prison.<br />|1200|
