δεσμώτης|desm�thj|desmztgs|1) one bound, a prisoner<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G1202</b><br />From the same as G1201; (passively) a <i>captive:</i> - prisoner.<br />|1202|
δεσπότης|desp�thj|desqptgs|1) a master, Lord<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 2:44, 145|<b>G1203</b><br />Perhaps from G1210 and <span class="uni">πόσις</span> posis (a <i>husband</i>); an absolute <i>ruler</i> ("despot"): - Lord, master.<br />|1203|
