διαλέγομαι|dial�gomai|dialecpmai|1) to think different things with one's self, mingle thought with thought<br />1a) to ponder, revolve in mind<br />2) to converse, discourse with one, argue, discuss<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 2:93, 155|<b>G1256</b><br />Middle voice from G1223 and G3004; to <i>say thoroughly</i>, that is, <i>discuss</i> (in argument or exhortation): - dispute, preach (unto), reason (with), speak.<br />|1256|
