διαπεράω|diaper�w|diaqeraz|1) to pass over, cross over, i.e. a river, a lake<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G1276</b><br />From G1223 and a derivative of the base of G4008; to <i>cross entirely:</i> - go over, pass (over), sail over.<br />|1276|
