διαρπάζω|diarp�zw|diarqafz|1) to plunder<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G1283</b><br />From G1223 and G726; to <i>seize asunder</i>, that is, <i>plunder:</i> - spoil.<br />|1283|
