διαφυλάσσω|diaful�ssw|diavulassz|1) to guard carefully<br />1a) the LXX used this especially of God's providential care<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G1314</b><br />From G1223 and G5442; to <i>guard thoroughly</i>, that is, <i>protect:</i> - keep.<br />|1314|
διαχειρίζομαι|diaceir�zomai|diaxeirifpmai|1) to move by the use of the hands, take in hand, manage, administer, govern<br />2) to lay hands on, slay, kill [with one's own hand]<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G1315</b><br />From G1223 and a derivative of G5495; to <i>handle thoroughly</i>, that is, <i>lay</i> violent <i>hands</i> upon: - kill, slay.<br />|1315|
διαχωρίζομαι|diacwr�zomai|diaxzrifpmai|1) to separate thoroughly or wholly<br />2) to separate one's self, depart<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G1316</b><br />From G1223 and the middle voice of G5563; to <i>remove</i> (oneself) <i>wholly</i>, that is, <i>retire:</i> - depart.<br />|1316|
