δραχμή|dracm�|draxmg|1) a drachma, a Greek silver coin about the same weight as a Roman denarius<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun feminine|<b>G1406</b><br />From G1405; a <i>drachma</i> or (silver) coin (as <i>handled</i>): - piece (of silver).<br />|1406|
