Δρούσιλλα|Dro�silla|drpusilla|Drusilla = "watered by the dew"<br />1) the daughter of Agrippa the elder, wife of Felix, the governor of Judaea, a most licentious woman<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun proper feminine|<b>G1409</b><br />A feminine diminutive of <i>Drusus</i> (a Roman name); <i>Drusilla</i>, a member of the Herodian family: - Drusilla.<br />|1409|
