δυσβάστακτος|dusb�staktoj|dusbastaktps|1) hard to be borne<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective|<b>G1419</b><br />From G1418 and a derivative of G941; <i>oppressive:</i> - grievous to be borne.<br />|1419|
