εὔθετος|e�qetoj|euhetps|1) well placed<br />1a) fit<br />1b) useful<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective|<b>G2111</b><br />From G2095 and a derivative of G5087; <i>well placed</i>, that is, (figuratively) <i>appropriate:</i> - fit, meet.<br />|2111|
εὐθέως|e�q�wj|euhezs|1) straightway, immediately, forthwith<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adverb|<b>G2112</b><br />Adverb from G2117; <i>directly</i>, that is, <i>at once</i> or <i>soon:</i> - anon, as soon as, forthwith, immediately, shortly, straightway.<br />|2112|
