ζῳογονέω|zJogon�w|fzpcpnez|1) to bring forth alive<br />2) to give life<br />3) to preserve alive<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 2:873, 290|<b>G2225</b><br />From the same as G2226 and a derivative of G1096; to <i>engender alive</i> that is, (by analogy) to <i>rescue</i> (passively <i>be saved</i>) from death: - live, preserve.<br />|2225|
