καταβαρέω|katabar�w|katabarez|1) to press down by an imposing weight<br />2) to weigh down<br />3) metaphorically to burden<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G2599</b><br />From G2596 and G916; to <i>impose upon:</i> - burden<br />|2599|
