καταγινώσκω|katagin�skw|katacinzskz|1) to find fault with, blame<br />2) to accuse, condemn<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 1:714, 119|<b>G2607</b><br />From G2596 and G1097; to <i>note against</i>, that is, <i>find fault with:</i> - blame, condemn.<br />|2607|
