κατακυριεύω|katakurie�w|katakurieuz|1) to bring under one's power, to subject one's self, to subdue, master<br />2) to hold in subjection, to be master of, exercise lordship over<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 3:1098, 486|<b>G2634</b><br />From G2596 and G2961; to <i>lord against</i>, that is, <i>control</i>, <i>subjugate:</i> - exercise dominion over (lordship), be lord over, overcome.<br />|2634|
