κατήγορος|kat�goroj|katgcprps|1) an accuser<br />1a) a name given to the devil by the rabbis<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 3:636, 422|<b>G2725</b><br />From G2596 and G58; <i>against</i> one in the <i>assembly</i>, that is, a <i>complainant</i> at law; specifically <i>Satan:</i> - accuser.<br />|2725|
