καυματίζω|kaumat�zw|kaumatifz|1) to burn with heat, to scorch<br />2) to be tortured with intense heat<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 3:643, 423|<b>G2739</b><br />From G2738; to <i>burn:</i> - scorch.<br />|2739|
