κοπετός|kopet�j|kpqetps|1) lamentation with beating of the breast as a sign of grief<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 3:830, 453|<b>G2870</b><br />From G2875; <i>mourning</i> (properly by <i>beating</i> the breast): - lamentation.<br />|2870|
