κριτικός|kritik�j|kritikps|1) relating to judging, fit for judging, skilled in judging<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 3:943, 469|<b>G2924</b><br />From G2923; <i>decisive</i> ("critical"), that is, <i>discriminative:</i> - discerner.<br />|2924|
