κρυσταλλίζω|krustall�zw|krustallifz|1) to be of crystalline brightness and transparency<br />2) to shine like crystal<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G2929</b><br />From G2930; to <i>make</i> (that is, intransitively <i>resemble</i>) <i>ice</i> ("crystallize"): - be clear as crystal.<br />|2929|
