κυλισμός|kulism�j|kulismps|1) thing rolled, rolled (wallowed) mud or mire<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun neuter|<b>G2946</b><br />From G2947; a <i>wallow</i> (the effect of <i>rolling</i>), that is, <i>filth:</i> - wallowing.<br />|2946|
κυλίομαι|kul�omai|kulipmai|1) a rolling, wallowing<br />2) to roll itself in mud<br />3) to wallowing in the mire<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G2947</b><br />From the base of G2949 (through the idea of <i>circularity</i>; compare G2945 and G1507); to <i>roll</i> about: - wallow.<br />|2947|
