κυρόω|kur�w|kurpz|1) to make valid<br />2) to confirm publicly or solemnly, to ratify<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 3:1098, 486|<b>G2964</b><br />From the same as G2962; to <i>make authoritative</i>, that is, <i>ratify:</i> - confirm.<br />|2964|
