κωλύω|kwl�w|kzluz|1) to hinder, prevent forbid<br />2) to withhold a thing from anyone<br />3) to deny or refuse one a thing<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G2967</b><br />From the base of G2849; to <i>estop</i>, that is, <i>prevent</i> (by word or act): - forbid, hinder, keep from, let, not suffer, withstand.<br />|2967|
