κωφός|kwf�j|kzvps|1) blunted, dull<br />1a) blunted (or lamed) in tongue, dumb<br />1b) blunted, dull in hearing<br />1c) deaf<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective|<b>G2974</b><br />From G2875; <i>blunted</i>, that is, (figuratively) of hearing (<i>deaf</i>) or speech (<i>dumb</i>): - deaf, dumb, speechless.<br />|2974|
