λαλέω|lal�w|lalez|1) to utter a voice or emit a sound<br />2) to speak<br />2a) to use the tongue or the faculty of speech<br />2b) to utter articulate sounds<br />3) to talk<br />4) to utter, tell<br />5) to use words in order to declare one's mind and disclose one's thoughts<br />5a) to speak<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 4:69, 505|<b>G2980</b><br />A prolonged form of an otherwise obsolete verb; to <i>talk</i>, that is, <i>utter</i> words: - preach, say, speak (after), talk, tell, utter. Compare G3004.<br />|2980|
