λαμπρός|lampr�j|lamqrps|1) shining<br />1a) brilliant<br />1b) clear, transparent<br />2) splendid, magnificent<br />2a) splendid things, i.e. luxuries or elegancies in dress or style<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 4:16, 497|<b>G2986</b><br />From the same as G2985; <i>radiant</i>; by analogy <i>limpid</i>; figuratively <i>magnificent</i> or <i>sumptuous</i> (in appearance): - bright, clear, gay, goodly, gorgeous, white.<br />|2986|
