λαμπρῶς|lampr�j|lamqrzs|1) splendidly, magnificently<br />1a) of sumptuous living<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adverb|<b>G2988</b><br />Adverb from G2986; <i>brilliantly</i>, that is, (figuratively) <i>luxuriously:</i> - sumptuously.<br />|2988|
