λίβανος|l�banoj|libanps|1) the frankincense tree<br />2) the perfume, frankincense<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G3030</b><br />Of foreign origin [H3828]; the <i>incense</i> tree, that is, (by implication) <i>incense</i> itself: - frankincense.<br />|3030|
