Ματθάν|Matq�n|mathan|Matthan = "gift"<br />1) one of Christ's ancestors<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G3157</b><br />Of Hebrew origin [H4977]; <i>Matthan</i> (that is, <i>Mattan</i>), an Israelite: - Matthan.<br />|3157|
