ξυράομαι|xur�omai|ourapmai|1) to shear, shave<br />2) to get one's self shaved<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G3587</b><br />From a derivative of the same as G3586 (meaning a <i>razor</i>); to <i>shave</i> or "shear" the hair: - shave.<br />|3587|
