οἰκοδεσποτέω|o�kodespot�w|pikpdesqptez|1) to be master (or head) of a house<br />2) to rule a household, manage family affairs<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 2:49, 145|<b>G3616</b><br />From G3617; to <i>be</i> the <i>head of</i> (that is, <i>rule</i>) <i>a family:</i> - guide the house.<br />|3616|
