ὅποτε|�pote|pqpte|1) when<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> particle|<b>G3698</b><br />From G3739 and G4218; <i>what</i> (-ever) <i>then</i>, that is, (of time) <i>as soon as:</i> - when.<br />|3698|
