ὁσάκις|�s�kij|psakis|1) as often as, as often soever as<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adverb|<b>G3740</b><br />Multiple adverb from G3739; <i>how</i> (that is, with G302, <i>so</i>) <i>many times</i> as: - as oft (-en) as.<br />|3740|
