ὀσμή|�sm�|psmg|1) a smell, odour<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun feminine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 5:493, 735|<b>G3744</b><br />From G3605; <i>fragrance</i> (literally or figuratively): - odour, savour.<br />|3744|
