πενθέω|penq�w|qenhez|1) to mourn<br />2) to mourn for, lament one<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 6:40, 825|<b>G3996</b><br />From G3997; to <i>grieve</i> (<i>the feeling or the act</i>): - mourn, (be-) wail.<br />|3996|
