πενιχρός|penicr�j|qenixrps|1) needy, poor<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 6:40, 824|<b>G3998</b><br />Prolonged from the base of G3993; <i>necessitous:</i> - poor.<br />|3998|
