περ|per|qer|1) however much, very much, altogether, indeed<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> particle|<b>G4007</b><br />From the base of G4008; an enclitic particle significant of <i>abundance</i> (<i>thoroughness</i>), that is, <i>emphasis</i>; <i>much</i>, <i>very</i> or <i>ever:</i> - [whom-] soever.<br />|4007|
