περικυκλόω|perikukl�w|qerikuklpz|1) to encircle, compass about<br />1a) of a city (besieged)<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4033</b><br />From G4012 and G2944; to <i>encircle</i> all <i>around</i>, that is, <i>blockade completely:</i> - compass round.<br />|4033|
