περιλείπομαι|perile�pomai|qerileiqpmai|1) to leave over<br />2) to remain over, to survive<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 4:194,*|<b>G4035</b><br />From G4012 and G3007; to <i>leave</i> all <i>around</i>, that is, (passively) <i>survive:</i> - remain.<br />|4035|
περίλυπος|per�lupoj|qeriluqps|1) very sad, exceedingly sorrowful<br />2) overcome with sorrow so much as to cause one's death<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 4:323, 540|<b>G4036</b><br />From G4012 and G3077; <i>grieved</i> all <i>around</i>, that is, <i>intensely sad:</i> - exceeding (very) sorry (-owful).<br />|4036|
περιμένω|perim�nw|qerimenz|1) to wait for<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 4:578, 581|<b>G4037</b><br />From G4012 and G3306; to <i>stay around</i>, that is, <i>await:</i> - wait for.<br />|4037|
πέριξ|p�rix|qerio|1) round about: the neighbouring cities<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adverb|<b>G4038</b><br />Adverb from G4012; all <i>around</i>, that is, (as adjective) <i>circumjacent:</i> - round about.<br />|4038|
περιοικέω|perioik�w|qeripikez|1) to dwell round about, to be one's neighbour<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4039</b><br />From G4012 and G3611; to <i>reside around</i>, that is, <i>be</i> a <i>neighbor:</i> - dwell round about.<br />|4039|
