πλέγμα|pl�gma|qlecma|1) what is woven, plaited, or twisted together<br />2) a web, plait, braid<br />2a) of a net<br />2b) of a basket, in which the infant Moses was laid<br />2c) of braided hair<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun neuter|<b>G4117</b><br />From G4120; a <i>plait</i> (of hair): - broidered hair.<br />|4117|
