πτοέομαι|pto�omai|qtpepmai|1) to terrify<br />2) be terrified<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4422</b><br />Probably akin to the alternate of G4098 (through the idea of causing to <i>fall</i>) or to G4072 (through that of causing to <i>fly</i> away); to <i>scare:</i> - frighten.<br />|4422|
