πτύσσω|pt�ssw|qtussz|1) to fold together, roll up<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4428</b><br />Probably akin to <span class="uni">πετάννυμι</span> petannumi (to <i>spread</i>; and thus apparently allied to G4072 through the idea of <i>expansion</i>, and to G4429 through that of <i>flattening</i>; compare G3961); to <i>fold</i>, that is, <i>furl</i> a scroll: - close.<br />|4428|
