πτῶμα|pt�ma|qtzma|1) a fall, downfall<br />1a) metaphorically a failure, defeat, calamity<br />1b) an error, lapse into sin<br />2) that which has fallen<br />2a) the fallen body of one dead or slain, a corpse, a carcase<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun neuter<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 6:166, 846|<b>G4430</b><br />From the alternate of G4098; a <i>ruin</i>, that is, (specifically) lifeless <i>body</i> (<i>corpse</i>, <i>carrion</i>): - dead body, carcase, corpse.<br />|4430|
