Σκευᾶς|Skeu�j|skeuas|Sceva = "mind reader"<br />1) a certain chief priest residing at Ephesus<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun proper masculine|<b>G4630</b><br />Apparently of Latin origin; <i>left handed</i>; <i>Scevas</i> (that is, <i>Scaevus</i>), an Israelite: - Sceva.<br />|4630|
