σπεύδω|spe�dw|sqeudz|1) to haste, make haste<br />2) to desire earnestly<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4692</b><br />Probably strengthened from G4228; to "speed" ("study"), that is, <i>urge</i> on (diligently or earnestly); by implication to <i>await</i> eagerly: - (make, with) haste unto.<br />|4692|
