σπόριμα|sp�rima|sqprima|1) fit for sowing, sown<br />2) sown fields, growing crops<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:536, 1065|<b>G4702</b><br />From G4703; <i>sown</i>, that is, (neuter plural) a planted <i>field:</i> - corn (-field).<br />|4702|
