σπουδάζω|spoud�zw|sqpudafz|1) to hasten, make haste<br />2) to exert one's self, endeavour, give diligence<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:559, 1069|<b>G4704</b><br />From G4710; to <i>use speed</i>, that is, to <i>make effort</i>, <i>be prompt</i> or <i>earnest:</i> - do (give) diligence, be diligent (forward), endeavour, labour, study.<br />|4704|
