σπουδή|spoud�|sqpudg|1) haste, with haste<br />2) earnestness, diligence<br />2a) earnestness in accomplishing, promoting, or striving after anything<br />2b) to give all diligence, interest one's self most earnestly<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun feminine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:559, 1069|<b>G4710</b><br />From G4692; "speed", that is, (by implication) <i>despatch</i>, <i>eagerness</i>, <i>earnestness:</i> - business, (earnest) care (-fulness), diligence forwardness, haste.<br />|4710|
