στῆθος|st�qoj|stghps|1) the breast<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun neuter|<b>G4738</b><br />From G2476 (as <i>standing</i> prominently); the (entire external) <i>bosom</i>, that is, <i>chest:</i> - breast.<br />|4738|
στήκω|st�kw|stgkz|1) to stand firm<br />2) to persevere, to persist<br />3) to keep one's standing<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:636, 1082|<b>G4739</b><br />From the perfect tense of G2476; to <i>be stationary</i>, that is, (figuratively) to <i>persevere:</i> - stand (fast).<br />|4739|
