σύ|s�|su|1) you<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> pronoun|<b>G4771</b><br />The personal pronoun of the second person singular; <i>thou</i>: - thou. See also G4571, G4671, G4675; and for the plur. G5209, G5210, G5213, G5216.<br />|4771|
