συγκακουχέομαι|sugkakouc�omai|suckakpuxepmai|1) to treat ill with another<br />2) to be ill treated in company with, share persecutions or come into a fellowship of ills<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4778</b><br />From G4862 and G2558; to <i>maltreat</i> in company <i>with</i>, that is, (passively) <i>endure persecution together:</i> - suffer affliction with.<br />|4778|
