σύμφυτος|s�mfutoj|sumvutps|1) born together with, of joint origin<br />1a) connate, congenital, innate, implanted by birth or nature<br />2) grown together, united with<br />3) kindred<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:786, 1102|<b>G4854</b><br />From G4862 and a derivative of G5453; <i>grown</i> along <i>with</i> (<i>connate</i>), that is, (figuratively) closely <i>united</i> to: - planted together.<br />|4854|
