συναθροίζω|sunaqro�zw|sunahrpifz|1) to gather together with others<br />2) to assemble<br />3) to be gathered together, i.e. to come together<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4867</b><br />From G4862 and <span class="uni">ἀθροίζω</span> athroiz&ocirc; (to <i>hoard</i>); to <i>convene:</i> - call (gather) together.<br />|4867|
