σύνδεσμος|s�ndesmoj|sundesmps|1) that which binds together, a band, bond<br />1a) of ligaments by which the members of the human body are united together<br />2) that which is bound together, a bundle<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:856, 1114|<b>G4886</b><br />From G4862 and G1199; a <i>joint tie</i>, that is, <i>ligament</i>, (figuratively) <i>uniting principle</i>, <i>control:</i> - band, bond.<br />|4886|
