συνεισέρχομαι|suneis�rcomai|suneiserxpmai|1) to enter together<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4897</b><br />From G4862 and G1525; to <i>enter</i> in company <i>with:</i> - go in with, go with into.<br />|4897|
συνέκδημος|sun�kdhmoj|sunekdgmps|1) a fellow traveller, companion in travel<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G4898</b><br />From G4862 and the base of G1553; a <i>co-absentee</i> from home, that is, <i>fellow traveller:</i> - companion in travel, travel with.<br />|4898|
