σύνεσις|s�nesij|sunesis|1) a running together, a flowing together with<br />2) knowledge<br />2a) understanding<br />2b) the understanding, i.e the mind so far forth as it understands<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun feminine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 7:888, 1119|<b>G4907</b><br />From G4920; a mental <i>putting together</i>, that is, <i>intelligence</i> or (concretely) the <i>intellect:</i> - knowledge, understanding.<br />|4907|
