συνευωχέομαι|suneuwc�omai|suneuzxepmai|1) to entertain together<br />2) to feast sumptuously with<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G4910</b><br />From G4862 and a derivative of a presumed compound of G2095 and a derivative of G2192 (meaning to <i>be in good condition</i>, that is, [by implication] to <i>fare well</i>, or <i>feast</i>); to <i>entertain</i> sumptuously in company <i>with</i>, that is, (middle or passive voice) to <i>revel together:</i> - feast with.<br />|4910|
