συνηλικιώτης|sunhliki�thj|sunglikiztgs|1) one of the same age, an equal in age<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G4915</b><br />From G4862 and a derivative of G2244; a <i>co-aged</i> person, that is, <i>alike</i> in years: - equal.<br />|4915|
