Σωσθένης|Swsq�nhj|szshengs|Sosthenes = "saviour of his nation"<br />1) a Jew at Corinth who was seized and beaten in the presence of Gallio<br />2) a certain Christian associate of Paul<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun proper masculine|<b>G4988</b><br />From the base of G4982 and that of G4599; <i>of safe strength</i>; <i>Sosthenes</i>, a Christian: - Sosthenes.<br />|4988|
