τεσσαρακονταετής|tessarakontaet�j|tessarakpntaetgs|1) of forty years, forty years old<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 8:135, 1172|<b>G5063</b><br />From G5062 and G2094; <i>of forty years</i> of age: - (+ full, of) forty years (old).<br />|5063|
