τεσσαρεσκαιδέκατος|tessareskaid�katoj|tessareskaidekatps|1) the fourteenth<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective|<b>G5065</b><br />From G5064 and G2532 and G1182; <i>fourteenth:</i> - fourteenth.<br />|5065|
τεταρταῖος|tetarta�oj|tetartaips|1) on the fourth day<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 8:127, 1172|<b>G5066</b><br />From G5064; pertaining to the <i>fourth</i> day: - four days.<br />|5066|
