τετρακισχίλιοι|tetrakisc�lioi|tetrakisxilipi|1) four thousand<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> adjective|<b>G5070</b><br />From the multiplicative adverb of G5064 and G5507; <i>four times a thousand:</i> - four thousand.<br />|5070|
