φιμόω|fim�w|vimpz|1) to close the mouth with a muzzle, to muzzle<br />2) metaphorically<br />2a) to stop the mouth, make speechless, reduce to silence<br />2b) to become speechless<br />3) to be kept in check<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G5392</b><br />From <span class="uni">φιμός</span> phimos (a <i>muzzle</i>); to <i>muzzle:</i> - muzzle.<br />|5392|
