φλογίζω|flog�zw|vlpcifz|1) to ignite, set on fire<br />2) to burn up<br />3) fig. to operate destructively, have a most pernicious power<br />3a) of that in which the destructive influences are kindled<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb|<b>G5394</b><br />From G5395; to <i>cause a blaze</i>, that is, <i>ignite</i> (figuratively to <i>inflame</i> with passion): - set on fire.<br />|5394|
