Φύγελος|F�geloj|vucelps|Phygellus = "a little fugitive"<br />1) a Christian who was with Paul and deserted him<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun proper masculine|<b>G5436</b><br />Probably from G5343; <i>fugitive</i>; <i>Phygellus</i>, an apostate Christian: - Phygellus.<br />|5436|
