χρυσίον|crus�on|xrusipn|1) gold, both that which lies imbedded in the earth and is dug out of it<br />2) that which has been smelted and wrought<br />2a) of a gold coin<br />2b) of golden ornaments<br />2c) of precious things made of gold<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun neuter|<b>G5553</b><br />Diminutive of G5557; a <i>golden</i> article, that is, gold plating, ornament, or coin: - gold.<br />|5553|
