χρυσόλιθος|crus�liqoj|xrusplihps|1) chrysolite is a precious stone of golden colour<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G5555</b><br />From G5557 and G3037; <i>gold stone</i>, that is, a <i>yellow gem</i> ("chrysolite"): - chrysolite.<br />|5555|
