ψευδόχριστος|yeud�cristoj|yeudpxristps|1) a false Christ (or Messiah)<br />2) one who falsely lays claim to the name and office of the Messiah<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun masculine|<b>G5580</b><br />From G5571 and G5547; a <i>spurious Messiah:</i> - false Christ.<br />|5580|
