Λευίς|Leu�|leui|Levi = "joined"<br />1) the third son of the patriarch Jacob by his wife Leah, the founder of the tribe of Israelites which bears his name<br />2) the son of Melchi, one of Christ's ancestors<br />3) the son of Simeon, an ancestor of Christ<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> noun proper masculine<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 4:234, 529|<b>G3017</b><br />Of Hebrew origin [H3878]; <i>Levi</i>, the name of three Israelites: - Levi. Compare G3018.<br />|3017|
