οὐχί|o�|pu|1) no, not; in direct questions expecting an affirmative answer<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> particle|<b>G3756</b><br />Also <span class="uni">οὐκ</span> ouk <i>ook</i> used before a vowel and <span class="uni">οὐχ</span> ouch <i>ookh</i> before an aspirate. <br />A primary word; the absolutely negative (compare G3361) adverb; <i>no</i> or <i>not</i>: - + long, nay, neither, never, no (X man), none, [can-] not, + nothing, + special, un ([-worthy]), when, + without, + yet but. See also G3364, G3372.<br />|3756|
