προσανατίθημι|prosanat�qemai|qrpsanatihemai|1) to lay upon in addition to<br />2) to lay upon one's self in addition<br />2a) to undertake besides<br />2b) to put one's self upon another by going to him<br />2c) to commit or betake one's self to another for the purpose of consulting him<br />2d) to consult, to take one into counsel<br />2e) to add from one's store<br />3) to communicate, impart<br /><b>Part of Speech:</b> verb<br /><b>Citing in TDNT:</b> 1:353, 57|<b>G4323</b><br />From G4314 and G394; to <i>lay up in addition</i>, that is, (middle voice and figuratively) to <i>impart</i> or (by implication) to <i>consult:</i> - in conference add, confer.<br />|4323|
